Error [E0305]: A map-pattern key must be written out
  --> pattern_ratified_map_dynamic_key.jet:2:17
    |
  2 |   if values == [key: value, ..] -> print(value)
    |                 ^^^
 Why: Each arm looks its keys up directly, so a key is a literal, an enum case or an ALL_CAPS constant
 Fix: Write the key as a literal or a constant, or test a computed key with a guard: `m.get(key) == .Val(v)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0305
